SEAM-Bench Dataset License
==========================

Copyright (c) 2027 the SEAM-Bench authors and the respective rights holders of
the underlying short dramas.

This dataset (screenplays, human-director storyboards, reference images, and
derived index/metadata files) is released under the

    Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
    (CC BY-NC 4.0)

license. Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode

You are free to:
  - Share  — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format.
  - Adapt  — remix, transform, and build upon the material.

Under the following terms:
  - Attribution  — You must give appropriate credit and cite the accompanying
    paper (see README.md), provide a link to the license, and indicate if
    changes were made.
  - NonCommercial — You may not use the material for commercial purposes,
    including training generative models intended for commercial release.

ADDITIONAL NOTICE
-----------------
The screenplays, storyboards, and reference images originate from produced
commercial short dramas and remain the property of their respective rights
holders. They are provided solely to enable non-commercial research on
storyboard-continuity evaluation. If you are a rights holder and have concerns
about any material in this repository, please open an issue and it will be
addressed promptly.
